00:05:51.430 --> 00:05:52.640
It’s you.

00:05:54.770 --> 00:05:56.780
We have nothing further to discuss.

00:05:57.620 --> 00:05:59.750
The incident was resolved.

00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:03.720
Ferry it on a Six-Scripted Lantern.

00:06:04.680 --> 00:06:06.400
Are you saying to forget it?

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:07.900
I’m on a hurry, so excuse me.

00:06:08.110 --> 00:06:09.160
Hypocrite!

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:15.430
Hypocrite!

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:16.600
Hypocrite!

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:19.110
Hypocrite! Hypocrite! Hypocrite!

00:06:19.740 --> 00:06:21.780
How could I forget?

00:06:21.780 --> 00:06:23.160
Never!

00:06:23.830 --> 00:06:25.840
Never!

00:06:28.770 --> 00:06:35.290
Note: Sign says, Police, Eradicate Drunk Driving. Movement for Safe Driving In Progress.

00:06:30.690 --> 00:06:35.290
Is it that person that’s frequently accessing our site?

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:40.020
She doesn’t type a name in, but her feelings are strong.

00:06:40.020 --> 00:06:41.270
Just to see how she’s doing.

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:45.160
Is the other person who she hates?

00:06:45.160 --> 00:06:49.300
He looks important, but what did he do?

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:51.510
I’ll go ask!

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:54.020
Hime! Wait!

00:06:54.020 --> 00:06:57.160
Why would I wait? It’s once in a lifetime!

00:06:58.120 --> 00:06:59.420
What the hell?

00:06:59.420 --> 00:07:02.300
Hime! Hime!

00:07:02.300 --> 00:07:03.420
My spring’s ran out.

00:07:16.730 --> 00:07:19.190
What a nice bath!

00:07:19.190 --> 00:07:22.750
Hey dad, look at this! I made this!

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:24.170
Oh, croquettes?

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:25.800
They look delicious!

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:26.850
Right?

00:07:27.010 --> 00:07:29.560
Good job, miss.

00:07:29.560 --> 00:07:30.860
Really?

00:07:30.860 --> 00:07:34.120
Although it’s a bit far from mom’s cooking.

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:40.600
Mom’s cooking is good, but make sure you study for those exams!

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:44.740
It’s OK! This teacher is really smart.

00:07:44.740 --> 00:07:46.740
Her name was…?

00:07:46.740 --> 00:07:47.960
Aketagawa-san.

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:52.390
Oh, right right. I left it up to you, so I haven’t seen her resumé.

00:07:52.390 --> 00:07:55.400
I should meet and greet her properly later.

00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:56.870
She’s really pretty!

00:07:56.870 --> 00:07:57.910
You idiot.

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:16.060
Aketagawa-sensei?

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:17.900
Oh, Akie-chan.

00:08:18.360 --> 00:08:20.200
What are you watching?

00:08:20.200 --> 00:08:22.540
Nothing really.

00:08:23.210 --> 00:08:24.880
Aim!

00:08:30.060 --> 00:08:33.090
Takasugi

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:36.880
I sounded so excited! “What, 100%?!”

00:08:37.550 --> 00:08:41.020
Oh, really? Amazing!

00:08:41.020 --> 00:08:46.670
I was the most surprised, that I could get 100%. I couldn’t believe myself!

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:52.060
That’s just ability! It’s obvious; you’re smart!

00:08:52.060 --> 00:08:54.110
Stop that!

00:08:54.110 --> 00:08:57.080
<i>That person is her tutor…</i>

00:09:08.620 --> 00:09:13.260
I saw her just now! Maybe not…

00:09:18.230 --> 00:09:20.030
That’s it for today.

00:09:25.090 --> 00:09:29.310
It’s so hot! Is your house close?

00:09:29.310 --> 00:09:30.440
It’s right there.

00:09:30.440 --> 00:09:33.110
I should’ve worn sun screen!

00:09:36.130 --> 00:09:39.560
Isn’t it dim? It’s in the shadow, so it’s always damp.

00:09:41.060 --> 00:09:42.150
Please come in.

00:09:42.150 --> 00:09:43.820
Excuse me.

00:09:46.830 --> 00:09:48.870
Mayama

00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:48.880
Father, I’m home.

00:09:55.990 --> 00:10:01.050
Father is always asleep, but he occasionally opens his eyes.

00:10:01.050 --> 00:10:03.980
Although he can’t talk.

00:10:03.980 --> 00:10:05.520
Was it an accident?

00:10:05.820 --> 00:10:08.950
It was a taxi driver, but…

00:10:08.950 --> 00:10:13.220
He got in a fight with a drunkard.

00:10:13.220 --> 00:10:17.110
When he was punched and fell over, the blow was in a bad spot.

00:10:18.280 --> 00:10:21.540
A drunkard… can’t forgive that, eh?

00:10:21.540 --> 00:10:23.710
But he was let go.

00:10:24.460 --> 00:10:27.220
A son of the prestigious Tsujinobashi family.

00:10:27.220 --> 00:10:29.480
They made the fight never happen,

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:32.580
so my father caused the accident himself.

00:10:32.580 --> 00:10:34.170
That’s horrible.

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:36.170
Horrible, right?

00:10:36.170 --> 00:10:39.350
That Tsujinobashi son later ran away to America, too.

00:10:39.980 --> 00:10:43.950
How about the police? They couldn’t help at all?

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:48.010
That was the problem. I can’t forgive that.

00:10:48.010 --> 00:10:49.260
What?

00:10:52.400 --> 00:10:56.120
The police didn’t have an investigation.

00:10:57.120 --> 00:10:59.460
The chief commanded it.

00:10:59.460 --> 00:11:00.740
The chief?

00:11:01.180 --> 00:11:04.270
Saigawara Police Chief,

00:11:04.270 --> 00:11:05.730
Takasugi Norihisa.

00:11:05.900 --> 00:11:07.200
What?!

00:11:09.330 --> 00:11:13.470
Yes, your father told a subordinate,

00:11:13.470 --> 00:11:15.770
“Make it so nothing happened”.

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:19.070
Lies! My father is not like that.

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:21.710
I’m sorry but it’s the truth, Akie-chan.

00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:25.850
I begrudge that Tsujinobashi son.

00:11:25.850 --> 00:11:29.230
But more than that, I begrudge chief Takasugi.

00:11:29.230 --> 00:11:35.670
While in a position to judge sins, he helped the criminal to save himself.

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:37.340
Hypocrite.

00:11:38.310 --> 00:11:43.360
Meeting you, his daughter by chance, and becoming so close.

00:11:43.360 --> 00:11:44.790
How ironic!

00:11:45.370 --> 00:11:51.980
But relax, I like you a lot. I would never begrudge you.

00:12:11.840 --> 00:12:14.140
What? You won’t go to high school?

00:12:15.770 --> 00:12:17.650
Miss!

00:12:17.650 --> 00:12:20.080
What are you saying, Akie?

00:12:20.080 --> 00:12:23.090
What are you going to do without going to high school?

00:12:23.090 --> 00:12:25.890
Is there something you want to do?

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:29.230
Then I’ll discuss. Try talking.

00:12:30.650 --> 00:12:32.870
Akie, raise your head.

00:12:38.560 --> 00:12:39.550
I’ll leave home.

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:44.790
The mansion you’re borrowing, I’ll live there from now on.

00:12:46.080 --> 00:12:47.920
What do you mean?

00:12:47.920 --> 00:12:51.310
I don’t understand! Explain so I can!

00:12:53.650 --> 00:12:55.200
I believed in you!

00:12:55.200 --> 00:12:57.290
Wait, Akie! Akie!

00:12:58.420 --> 00:13:01.260
Really, what does she mean?

00:13:03.310 --> 00:13:09.120
I won’t make it end so quickly. Suffer! Suffer!

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:11.970
Your heart shall be torn to shreds!

00:13:11.970 --> 00:13:13.300
And finally…

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:26.640
How nice! Living in such a nice mansion just for a change.

00:13:26.640 --> 00:13:28.400
I’m jealous!

00:13:28.400 --> 00:13:31.450
Yup, just for the change, just for the change!

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:34.040
Yuzuki, why don’t you study here, too?

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:36.180
Yeah, you should!

00:13:36.180 --> 00:13:36.840
But…

00:13:37.510 --> 00:13:39.020
Oh, looks like you’re doing it.

00:13:41.030 --> 00:13:42.200
Sensei!

00:13:42.490 --> 00:13:46.710
I’m glad you came over to help moving!

00:13:47.210 --> 00:13:49.850
Hey, will you come with us tonight?

00:13:49.850 --> 00:13:54.570
The Six-Scripted Lanterns? Sorry, I’ve got something.

00:13:54.570 --> 00:13:58.040
No, really? Shock!

00:13:58.040 --> 00:14:01.300
Oh, this girl’s Yuzuki, my best friend.

00:14:01.300 --> 00:14:04.270
My tutor, Aketagawa Azusa.

00:14:04.270 --> 00:14:05.190
Good afternoon!

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:06.950
Good afternoon!

00:14:26.540 --> 00:14:28.410
Jigoku Shoujo

00:14:32.310 --> 00:14:34.410
Father

00:14:44.870 --> 00:14:47.050
What’s up, Akie?

00:14:52.230 --> 00:14:53.490
Akie?

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:54.410
I quit.

00:14:55.030 --> 00:14:55.870
Are you OK?

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:57.210
Sorry, I’m going home early!

00:14:57.210 --> 00:14:58.170
Akie!

00:14:58.420 --> 00:15:02.140
Tomorrow, after the writing course, come over to the mansion!

00:15:02.140 --> 00:15:06.870
Akie! Wait a moment! Akie! I said, Akie!

00:15:06.870 --> 00:15:12.130
Really… even though I wanted to have fun together!

00:15:25.510 --> 00:15:27.060
It’s shining.

00:16:18.870 --> 00:16:20.000
Me?

00:16:28.070 --> 00:16:29.240
Stop.

00:16:29.240 --> 00:16:30.410
Who are you?

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:35.950
If you go, you can’t come back.

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:40.780
Shibata-sensei, can you see it?

00:16:42.030 --> 00:16:43.120
Sensei?

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:57.210
Akie!

00:17:00.350 --> 00:17:03.770
If you were a bit faster, you could’ve made it to the Six-Script Lanterns.

00:17:04.280 --> 00:17:05.660
Here, some grapes.

00:17:05.660 --> 00:17:08.620
They look delicious! Thank you!

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:12.760
I’m disappointed, since there were so many things I wanted to forget.

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:13.810
Here you go.

00:17:16.070 --> 00:17:17.110
Is it good?

00:17:17.110 --> 00:17:18.160
Yes!

00:17:18.160 --> 00:17:19.910
Then, one more.

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:27.820
Why not take a shower?

00:17:27.820 --> 00:17:31.120
My bad, I’ll go take a shower!

00:17:32.540 --> 00:17:34.420
You don’t need to rush.

00:17:38.190 --> 00:17:41.070
It’s me. Do it now.

00:17:51.230 --> 00:17:52.190
Azusa-san?

00:17:55.040 --> 00:17:56.000
Who are you?!

00:17:56.710 --> 00:17:58.460
Stop! Stop!

00:17:58.460 --> 00:17:59.030
<i>Sensei?!</i>

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:02.730
Stop! Stop!

00:18:05.280 --> 00:18:11.260
Takasugi-san, maybe you should come over quickly, although I doubt you’ll make it in time.

00:18:15.480 --> 00:18:16.780
Akie!

00:18:18.870 --> 00:18:19.960
You!

00:18:21.460 --> 00:18:23.090
Akie, are you OK?

00:18:23.510 --> 00:18:25.730
I’m here. Everything’s going to be all right.

00:18:26.980 --> 00:18:27.770
Akie!

00:18:28.240 --> 00:18:30.540
Yuzuki-chan told me.

00:18:31.080 --> 00:18:32.480
Yuzuki…

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:33.800
Yup.

00:18:35.510 --> 00:18:39.190
You! But it’s fine. Then…

00:18:39.190 --> 00:18:39.690
Don’t!

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:44.040
You’re planning to send Akie’s father to Hell, right?

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:46.510
Even though you don’t know anything about the situation, don’t get in the way!

00:18:46.510 --> 00:18:48.470
Circumstances don’t matter!

00:18:48.470 --> 00:18:50.980
Revenge in that way is wrong!

00:18:51.320 --> 00:18:53.700
Shut up! What do you know?!

00:18:54.160 --> 00:18:54.950
Stop!

00:18:55.960 --> 00:18:58.050
Let go! Let go!

00:18:58.050 --> 00:18:59.300
Never!

00:19:02.230 --> 00:19:04.440
Return it! Return it!

00:19:07.960 --> 00:19:09.460
S-Sensei!

00:19:09.460 --> 00:19:12.640
Mayama Azusa, you were Aketagawa?!

00:19:18.740 --> 00:19:19.870
Wait!

00:19:19.870 --> 00:19:23.050
I’m done with this… done.

00:19:23.050 --> 00:19:24.140
Akie…

00:19:28.070 --> 00:19:29.030
Akie…

00:19:29.030 --> 00:19:32.170
Don’t, please!

00:19:36.100 --> 00:19:38.020
Akie…

00:20:33.170 --> 00:20:36.470
The rest is up to you.

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:40.570
What is up to me?

00:20:40.570 --> 00:20:43.080
What do you mean? Jigoku Shoujo!

00:21:02.610 --> 00:21:04.780
This time it’s welcome back.

00:21:04.780 --> 00:21:08.000
So you’ve returned! You must be tired!

00:21:09.460 --> 00:21:12.010
Yes, I’m back.

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:26.520
<i>Jigoku Shoujo left! Everything’ll be back to normal!</i>

00:21:27.320 --> 00:21:30.830
<i>I’ll go meet Akie tomorrow.</i>

00:21:30.830 --> 00:21:33.670
<i>I have to, I have to!</i>

00:21:43.500 --> 00:21:44.500
Akie?

00:21:44.840 --> 00:21:46.500
Akie!

00:21:48.680 --> 00:21:50.190
Akie!

00:21:51.150 --> 00:21:52.450
Yuzuki!

00:21:59.930 --> 00:22:01.650
Akie?

00:22:01.650 --> 00:22:02.860
Akie!

00:22:03.700 --> 00:22:04.870
Akie?

00:22:04.870 --> 00:22:05.870
Akie!

00:22:06.120 --> 00:22:08.090
Akie!

00:22:08.250 --> 00:22:09.340
Akie!

00:22:42.870 --> 00:22:48.060
<i>That was the beginning of a new pain.</i>

00:24:19.970 --> 00:24:45.060
Preview

00:24:19.970 --> 00:24:45.060
Preview

00:24:19.970 --> 00:24:45.060
Preview

00:24:19.970 --> 00:24:45.060
Preview

00:24:19.970 --> 00:24:45.060
Preview

00:24:19.970 --> 00:24:45.060
Preview

00:24:19.970 --> 00:24:45.060
Preview

00:24:19.970 --> 00:24:45.060
Preview

00:24:19.970 --> 00:24:45.060
Preview

00:24:19.970 --> 00:24:45.060
Preview

00:24:19.970 --> 00:24:45.060
Preview

00:24:19.970 --> 00:24:45.060
Preview

00:24:20.800 --> 00:24:22.090
Your name?

00:24:22.090 --> 00:24:23.390
Kashiwagi Hidemi.

00:24:23.640 --> 00:24:27.860
You got in quite a situation when you missed the last train.

00:24:27.860 --> 00:24:31.630
I was never afraid of rumors around me.

00:24:31.630 --> 00:24:35.100
Because I thought that truth would speak.

00:24:35.100 --> 00:24:38.690
But, what should I do? At this rate, I’ll…

00:24:38.690 --> 00:24:41.410
Please, send them to Hell!

00:24:41.410 --> 00:24:42.960
I’m in a fix!

00:24:42.960 --> 00:24:45.010
What shall we do, Ojou?

00:24:45.020 --> 00:24:49.810
The Street Corner of Hatred

